      "content": "Thanks. But I also need to make sure the student understands the other side of the debate. Some scholars argue that prioritizing national identity over global integration is actually a regressive approach that ignores the benefits of international cooperation and can lead to isolationism. How should the student address those counter-arguments in their essay?",
